  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25600170",
      "title": "Dispatching Actions From Inside Components",
      "sourceHash": "46cacc50f9eab0cbd610bd964a618be6b3447a64d757c6e4d816fa9192ad18ad",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 4.15,
          "en": "Now for dispatching actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.15,
          "end": 7.32,
          "en": "I first of all, want to have two new buttons here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.32,
          "end": 9.46,
          "en": "which allow me to dispatch actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.46,
          "end": 12.173,
          "en": "for incrementing and decrementing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.41,
          "end": 15.11,
          "en": "So here I'll add a new div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.11,
          "end": 18.8,
          "en": "And in that div I'll just add two buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.8,
          "end": 23.8,
          "en": "The first one says increment, the second one says decrement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.95,
          "end": 27.32,
          "en": "So that we have these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.32,
          "end": 28.63,
          "en": "And now to add some spacing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.63,
          "end": 31.69,
          "en": "I'll quickly dive into counter.module.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.65,
          "end": 37.47,
          "en": "and add this selector .counter button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.47,
          "end": 39.473,
          "en": "which selects these buttons here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.36,
          "end": 42.43,
          "en": "And I'll just give them a margin of one rem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.43,
          "end": 45.743,
          "en": "in all directions, just so that we have some spacing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.81,
          "end": 49.64,
          "en": "Now, with that added, with that setup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.64,
          "end": 52.18,
          "en": "now we want to wire up those two buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.18,
          "end": 53.99,
          "en": "increment and decrement,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.99,
          "end": 58.173,
          "en": "so that they do increase or decrease the counter by one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.15,
          "end": 62.14,
          "en": "Now we know that we need to dispatch an action before that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.14,
          "end": 65.83,
          "en": "But how does that work from inside a react component?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.83,
          "end": 68.18,
          "en": "Well, there is another hook which we can use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.18,
          "end": 70.313,
          "en": "the use dispatch hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.44,
          "end": 75.93,
          "en": "When we call use dispatch here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.93,
          "end": 78.77,
          "en": "we don't pass any argument to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.77,
          "end": 83.03999999999999,
          "en": "but instead, this gives us back a dispatch function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.03999999999999,
          "end": 84.57,
          "en": "which you can execute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.57,
          "end": 87.3,
          "en": "So this patch here is a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.3,
          "end": 88.85,
          "en": "a function which we can call,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.85,
          "end": 93.423,
          "en": "which will dispatch an action against our Redux store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.77000000000001,
          "end": 95.60300000000001,
          "en": "So therefore now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.60300000000001,
          "end": 99.36,
          "en": "I'll add two new functions here in this counter component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.36,
          "end": 102.8,
          "en": "The increment handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 109.65,
          "en": "and the detriment handler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.65,
          "end": 114.39,
          "en": "So two new functions which will wire up to the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.39,
          "end": 116.88,
          "en": "And in the increment handler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 119.9,
          "en": "we want to use this dispatch function and execute it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.9,
          "end": 123.98,
          "en": "to dispatch a new action and then do what we learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.98,
          "end": 127.72,
          "en": "An action is an object with a type property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.72,
          "end": 129.38,
          "en": "So let's add such an object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.38,
          "end": 132.81,
          "en": "as an argument to the dispatch function call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.81,
          "end": 136.26,
          "en": "so that we dispatch this specific object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 138.78,
          "en": "And then the value for type should be one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.78,
          "end": 142.313,
          "en": "of the identifiers we use in our Redux store reducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.47,
          "end": 145.52,
          "en": "So here in the reducer function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.52,
          "end": 147.93,
          "en": "we handle the action type increment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.93,
          "end": 150.23,
          "en": "and the action type detriment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.23,
          "end": 153.73,
          "en": "So we should dispatch one of these two identifiers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.73,
          "end": 156.51,
          "en": "Of course, exactly these identifiers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.51,
          "end": 158.963,
          "en": "without any typos or changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.46,
          "end": 164.91,
          "en": "So back in counter here, I'll dispatch increment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.36,
          "end": 168.79,
          "en": "and then here in the detriment handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.79,
          "end": 171.86,
          "en": "I'll dispatch an object with a type property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.86,
          "end": 174.083,
          "en": "with a value of decrement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.17000000000002,
          "end": 178.75,
          "en": "Now we need to wire up those two functions to the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.75,
          "end": 183.75,
          "en": "So this first button we add an on click prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.26,
          "end": 186.55,
          "en": "and point at the increment handler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.55,
          "end": 187.68,
          "en": "And on the second button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.68,
          "end": 190.583,
          "en": "we do the same for the decrement handler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.62,
          "end": 193.483,
          "en": "And if we do that and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.55,
          "end": 199.25,
          "en": "if we now click increment, you see the counter increases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.25,
          "end": 202.86,
          "en": "and if you click decrement, it decreases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.86,
          "end": 206.76,
          "en": "So now we're able to use what we learned about Redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.76,
          "end": 211.193,
          "en": "in this react demo, in this react component here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}